  "details": "Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Join https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_cdf2df8f-19e1-436f-8386-c56414f1dc99/info\n\n2. Go to the seating area.\n\n3. Play an unlocked video from the playlist.\n\n4. Watch the main screen for 30–60 seconds.\n\nActual Result\n\n- Video on the screen looks like ~10–15 fps.\n\n- Playback sometimes freezes briefly.\n\n- World rendering and head tracking stay smooth.\n\nExpected Result\n\n- Video plays smoothly, including 60 fps content.\n\nDetails\n\nPlatform:\tQuest 3\n\nWorld:\twrld_cdf2df8f-19e1-436f-8386-c56414f1dc99\n\nVideo format:\tHLS (.m3u8)\n\nPlayer:\tProTV / AVPro 3.3.6\n\nRegression\tWorked before recent client update; broken after\n\nImpact\n\nCinema playback is unusable on Quest 3 at these low video framerates.",
